#1107
At The Standing Stone~
You move about the blades of grass, much liked you used to move about the
great forests.  You hear the clicks and hum's of various insects and other
creatures that make their home in the grass.  You reach a clearing where the
standing stone you saw from the road stands.  Above it, the clouds seem to
swirl in a very strange way.
~
